    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5b9359a9ceed4258bc9292683b25daca",
      "statement": "commandPreRun resolves exactly one of two AWS roles per command: the invoker role (session rosa-boundary-invoker, 900s STS duration; requires invoker_role_arn and lambda_function_name, plus ecs_cluster_name under session) for investigation/session create and for investigation close --status; the shared SRE role (session rosa-boundary-session, 3600s; requires sre_role_arn) for every other authenticated command, with investigation list requiring efs_filesystem_id instead of ecs_cluster_name, session join --auto-close additionally requiring invoker_role_arn/lambda_function_name before interactive sign-in, and investigation close (non-status) requiring efs_filesystem_id plus invoker_role_arn/lambda_function_name unless --dry-run. A non-dry-run close therefore previews the workspace with SRE credentials from commandPreRun and separately assumes the invoker role inside the close command itself to submit the request.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/cmd/cli.go#L96-L146",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:569c750384d391131211e9585f453cc0a3522ce99799cf778e2a5e511e8f1ac7:"
